WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.885
Mazatl and his father had traded all their corn.

2
00:00:07.886 --> 00:00:12.287
In return, they received goods their family needed.

3
00:00:12.288 --> 00:00:14.763
The market was closing.

4
00:00:14.764 --> 00:00:18.881
Most sellers were quickly wrapping up their blankets.

5
00:00:18.882 --> 00:00:25.339
"What’s going on?" Mandy asked. "Mazatl, where’s Vinnie?"

6
00:00:25.340 --> 00:00:30.269
"The priests will make an offering to our gods," replied Mazatl.

7
00:00:30.270 --> 00:00:32.404
"Follow me to the temple.

8
00:00:32.405 --> 00:00:36.379
I’m sure Vinnie will be there."

9
00:00:36.380 --> 00:00:40.919
Vinnie heard the drums beating faster and faster.

10
00:00:40.920 --> 00:00:44.946
He turned and saw a parade leaving the ball court.

11
00:00:44.947 --> 00:00:47.159
The game was over.

12
00:00:47.160 --> 00:00:51.478
Men in animal costumes danced around.

13
00:00:51.479 --> 00:00:54.005
Some pretended to fight.

14
00:00:54.006 --> 00:00:57.473
Other people sang and chanted loudly.

15
00:00:57.474 --> 00:01:00.098
People were playing flutes too.

16
00:01:00.099 --> 00:01:03.618
Vinnie thought it was a victory celebration.

17
00:01:03.619 --> 00:01:07.037
"Who won?" he asked a young boy.

18
00:01:07.038 --> 00:01:10.103
"Who cares?" replied the boy.

19
00:01:10.104 --> 00:01:12.535
"All the players are prisoners.

20
00:01:12.536 --> 00:01:14.808
Today the losers will die.

21
00:01:14.809 --> 00:01:19.154
But all the prisoners will be given to the gods someday soon."

22
00:01:19.155 --> 00:01:24.284
The crowd was now heading toward the pyramid.

23
00:01:24.285 --> 00:01:30.692
"What? The losing team is going to die?" gasped Vinnie.

24
00:01:30.693 --> 00:01:34.874
"Their blood will be given to the gods," said the young boy.

25
00:01:34.875 --> 00:01:39.700
"In return, the gods will give us good weather for our crops."

26
00:01:39.701 --> 00:01:42.274
Vinnie could not believe it!

27
00:01:42.275 --> 00:01:45.207
He watched the players who had lost.

28
00:01:45.208 --> 00:01:50.497
Tied together, the group was being pushed forward by the temple guards.

29
00:01:50.498 --> 00:01:54.466
Vinnie didn’t want to see what was about to happen.

30
00:01:54.467 --> 00:01:58.339
But the crowd shoved him up front.

31
00:01:58.340 --> 00:02:03.415
"Mandy! Mazatl!" he shouted as loud as he

32
00:02:03.416 --> 00:02:07.275
could. But the drums continued to beat

33
00:02:07.276 --> 00:02:09.549
louder. No one could hear

34
00:02:09.550 --> 00:02:13.269
him. Mandy followed Mazatl to the

35
00:02:13.270 --> 00:02:19.281
temple. "It’s amazing!" she remarked when she saw the tall

36
00:02:19.282 --> 00:02:23.267
pyramid. She asked Mazatl about the two buildings on the

37
00:02:23.268 --> 00:02:27.419
top. "Those are where the sacrifices are held," he

38
00:02:27.420 --> 00:02:33.072
explained. "Why are these people being killed?" she asked

39
00:02:33.073 --> 00:02:37.666
carefully. "Today is a festival to honor our gods," said

40
00:02:37.667 --> 00:02:39.666
Mazatl. Mandy

41
00:02:39.667 --> 00:02:44.035
understood. To Mazatl, the gods controlled the lives of his

42
00:02:44.036 --> 00:02:47.203
family. Sacrifice was important to the

43
00:02:47.204 --> 00:02:54.006
gods. So people had to die for the future well-being of the

44
00:02:54.007 --> 00:02:57.278
Aztecs. "Mazatl, do you see

45
00:02:57.279 --> 00:03:01.681
Vinnie? Oh, where is he?" she

46
00:03:01.682 --> 00:03:03.271
cried. "I don’t see

47
00:03:03.272 --> 00:03:08.009
him. He must be trapped in the crowd somewhere," replied

48
00:03:08.010 --> 00:03:10.615
Mazatl. Mandy yelled for

49
00:03:10.616 --> 00:03:15.210
Vinnie. Worried, she ran as fast as she could toward the

50
00:03:15.211 --> 00:03:20.872
temple. Meanwhile, Vinnie managed to break away from the

51
00:03:20.873 --> 00:03:23.550
crowd. "Whew! I can

52
00:03:23.551 --> 00:03:26.405
breathe!" he said, wiping his

53
00:03:26.406 --> 00:03:30.938
forehead. A single line of men moved slowly in front of

54
00:03:30.939 --> 00:03:33.614
him. Vinnie felt someone push him

55
00:03:33.615 --> 00:03:38.001
hard. "Hey!" Vinnie turned

56
00:03:38.002 --> 00:03:41.017
angrily. The person pushing him held a

57
00:03:41.018 --> 00:03:43.673
spear—it was a temple guard!

58
00:03:43.674 --> 00:03:47.219
Only then did Vinnie realize where he was.

59
00:03:47.220 --> 00:03:50.274
He was in the line to be sacrificed.

60
00:03:50.275 --> 00:03:52.468
He tried to explain.

61
00:03:52.469 --> 00:03:54.814
"There’s been a mistake!"

62
00:03:54.815 --> 00:04:01.342
But the guard only pushed him forward again.

